OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786884510
OL,3,CFire sweeps through hay barn causing
OL,4,Cextensive damage
OL,6,FA fire that destroyed a hay barn near
OL,7,FWareham is being treated as arson.
OL,9,FCrews from Dorset and Wiltshire Fire
OL,10,Fand Rescue were called to barn
OL,11,Fcontaining 2,000 bales of hay at
OL,12,Faround 3am this morning, Saturday 15th
OL,13,FAugust.
OL,15,FAround sixty firefighters from across
OL,16,FDorset tackled the blaze at East
OL,17,FLulworth.
OL,19,FA neighbouring, derelict outbuilding
OL,20,Fhas also been destroyed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
