OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786884510
OL,3,CFire sweeps through hay barn causing
OL,4,Cextensive damage
OL,6,FAt the height of the incident, crews
OL,7,Ffrom Poole, Hamworthy, Swanage,
OL,8,FRedhill Park, Westbourne, Dorchester,
OL,9,FWimborne, Maiden Newton, Weymouth,
OL,10,FBlandford and Beaminster were in
OL,11,Fattendance.
OL,13,FFirefighters have been working hard to
OL,14,Fprevent the fire spreading to adjacent
OL,15,Ftrees, land and property.
OL,17,FCrews are likely to remain on site for
OL,18,Ffor some considerable time.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
