OL,3,CFire sweeps through hay barn causing
OL,4,Cextensive damage
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Dorset and
OL,7,FWiltshire Fire and Rescue said: "We
OL,8,Fcurrently believe the fire to have
OL,9,Fbeen started deliberately and
OL,10,Finvestigations are ongoing."
